@startuml
' AD-027; source ../use-cases/UC-027-consult-ai-chat-stylist.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-CHAT-001; BR-027; CAP-12; PBI-044; US-CHAT-001 AC.
' SRS: FR-CHAT-001, FR-CHAT-002, FR-CHAT-003, FR-CHAT-004, FR-CHAT-005, FR-CHAT-006, FR-CHAT-007; DATA-CHAT-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-CHAT-001/002; BRULE-PERS-001; BRULE-GAR-001/002; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q03, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-027 - Consult the single-thread AI Chat Stylist
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-027;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|User|
if (Attach garment photo?) then (Yes)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Route permitted photo to Add Garment (UC-007);
  :Require review and explicit confirmation;
  :No ownership from attachment alone;
else (Text / chip)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Use single thread and authorized relevant context;
  :Show pending reply;
  if (AI reply available?) then (Yes)
    :Show reply, identified outfit / item cards and chips;
    |User|
    :Continue text / chips or choose suggestion feedback;
    |CapsuleAI|
    :Route AI suggestion feedback through UC-013;
  else (Failed / unavailable)
    :Explain actual unavailable state;
    :Offer retry / independent wardrobe use;
  endif
endif
note right
  One thread; no multithread product history.
  No invented missing context, provider or training consent.
  Chat retention / context exchange require refinement.
end note

stop
@enduml
